# 📊 DATABASE SCHEMA - Kashaya Fabs ERP

> **Complete database structure for the garment manufacturing ERP system**

**Last Updated:** October 23, 2025
**Database:** PostgreSQL 15+
**ORM:** Prisma
**Total Tables:** 48 tables
**Total Enums:** 20 enums

