## DATABASE INDEXES

### Primary Indexes
All tables have UUID primary keys with automatic indexing.

### Unique Constraints
- **Email addresses** (users)
- **Code fields** (customers, suppliers, materials, styles, locations)
- **Number fields** (orders, invoices, work orders, quotations, etc.)
- **Composite unique** (stock tables)

### Performance Indexes
- **Foreign keys** - All foreign key fields
- **Search fields** - Email, code, name
- **Date fields** - Transaction dates, creation dates
- **Status fields** - Order status, production stage
- **Lookup fields** - Category IDs, location IDs

### Composite Indexes
- (materialId, locationId) on inventory_stock
- (orderItemId, colorId, sizeId) on order_item_breakup
- (workOrderId, colorId, sizeId) on work_order_breakup
- (styleId, colorId, sizeId, locationId) on finished_goods_stock

